# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VAYU ORBIT — Production Vercel Frontend Environment Template (Example)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this template to .env.vercel or import these keys into your Vercel
# Project Settings under "Environment Variables" (Production & Preview).
#
# NOTE: All values below are public frontend descriptors. No backend secrets,
# private tokens, or database credentials belong in the Vercel environment.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. Target Backend API Endpoint (MANDATORY) ──────────────────────────────
# The HTTPS URL of your deployed FastAPI backend service (e.g. on Render).
# Must point to your live backend endpoint.
VITE_API_BASE=https://vayu-orbit.onrender.com

# ── 2. TomTom Maps & Routing API Key (OPTIONAL / RECOMMENDED) ────────────────
# Free tier TomTom Developer API Key for road network cartography and routing.
# Acquire from: https://developer.tomtom.com/
# If left empty, VAYU ORBIT activates its offline tactical vector map canvas.
VITE_TOMTOM_API_KEY=YOUR_TOMTOM_API_KEY_HERE
